  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "しんどうで　おんぱを　おこして\nこうげきする。あいての　とくぼうを\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "진동으로 음파를 일으켜서\n공격한다. 상대의 특수방어를\n떨어뜨릴 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "利用振動產生出的音波進行攻擊。\n有時會降低對手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur fait vibrer son corps pour lancer une vague\nsonique. Peut aussi baisser la Défense Spéciale\nde l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender erzeugt Schallwellen, die beim Ziel Schaden\nverursachen und eventuell dessen Spezial-Verteidigung\nsenken.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario crea una onda sónica dañina moviendo su\ncuerpo que también puede disminuir la Defensa\nEspecial del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa crea un’onda sonora che infligge danni.\nPuò anche ridurre la Difesa Speciale del bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user generates a damaging sound wave by\nvibration. This may also lower the target’s\nSp. Def stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "振動で　音波を　おこして\n攻撃する。相手の　特防を\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "利用振动发出音波进行攻击。\n有时会降低对手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario crea una onda sónica dañina moviendo su\ncuerpo que también puede disminuir la Defensa\nEspecial del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
